{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚抓住了热切退去后身体得以松动、亲近的余温内化为可独自回味的快乐，以及这份快乐为何仍与孤单和牵挂并存；但它没有具体说明酸楚为何恰在此刻冒出、旋律中的插话如何推动情绪起伏，身体变化与未解牵挂的关系也主要依靠前段标签带过。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙把快乐开始显得像回忆、无法确认对方是否同样惦念分别连到回望的酸楚与反复的心紧，并解释不把暂时没有直接回应视为拒绝为何能让温柔恢复，还为脆弱感和沉浸式听法提供了因果依据；但H/M编号不够自明，身体反应先于念头的过程仍只点到为止，时间意识与互相惦念等机制也属于有根据的诠释而非听感能够证实的事实。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙保留了甲关于余温内化、独处的孤单和牵挂未解的核心，又更具体地解释了情绪此刻转折的触发因素、拉扯的起伏以及应对方式如何改变后续感受，因此即使部分机制仍依赖编号和推断，也没有构成实质退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d1a92bf8-63c7-423f-94c5-9905279491bd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133542280129Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:37:46.862698+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7e252b5fd1a758ee9db5ee034f6e722bc75a4d22d34d5dc67f7f94abb072406a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb